# microservice specific routes

GET       /traders/get-known-facts          uk.gov.hmrc.euvatrefunds.controllers.EuVatCacheController.getTraderKnownFacts()

POST      /get-latest-application           uk.gov.hmrc.euvatrefunds.controllers.EuVatCandeController.getLatestApplications
